      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Everyone can go through two types of painful feelings: one is related to suffering, the other to psychic pain. Suffering is the expression of an activity of compromise which is itself linked to our attempts to adapt to our internal and external reality. Pain is above all a breach: a breach of the body in the case of physical pain, a breach of the psyche in the case of psychic pain."},
